                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Nothing to dislike. Everything to like. Except may be not-togglable narrative. For a long time I was looking for a game which would help me pass the time like I did before with games like Diablo II or (sorry) Torchlight II or D&D ARPGs. And it's even more awesome in some aspects than they were. I wonder how I discovered it just now, thanks to ChatGPT suggestion. See you when I play more of it. \r\n\r\nP.S. I have problems with running it on M1 Max, it starts OK only every fifth-sixth time, but I can handle that.",
